# IntraCore: параметры HAL блока из базы STM32CubeMX (db/mcu/IP/*_Modes.xml).
# Порождено tools/hal_import — руками не править. Формат: src/Docs/Description/HalCatalogFormat.md
[Ip]
Name=USB_HOST
Version=v1.0_Cube

[Parameters]
# имя|подпись|группа|единица|мин|макс|описание
USBH_MAX_NUM_ENDPOINTS|USBH_MAX_NUM_ENDPOINTS (Maximum number of endpoints)|Host Configuration||1|255|Maximum number of supported endpoints per interface for All Classes. <font color="red"> The allocated memory for USBH_MAX_NUM_INTERFACES and USBH_MAX_NUM_ENDPOINTS should not exceed the total size of available memory. </font>
USBH_MAX_NUM_INTERFACES|USBH_MAX_NUM_INTERFACES (Maximun number of interfaces)|Host Configuration||1|255|Maximum number of supported Interfaces. <font color="red"> The allocated memory for USBH_MAX_NUM_INTERFACES and USBH_MAX_NUM_ENDPOINTS should not exceed the total size of available memory. </font>
USBH_MAX_NUM_SUPPORTED_CLASS|USBH_MAX_NUM_SUPPORTED_CLASS (Maximun number of supported class)|Host Configuration||1|255|Maximum number of supported Classes
USBH_USE_OS|USBH_USE_OS (Enable the support of an RTOS)|CMSIS_RTOS||||Enable RTOS support
USBH_PROCESS_PRIO|USBH_PROCESS_PRIO (The CMSIS-RTOS osPriority value specifies the priority for the USB Host thread)|CMSIS_RTOS||||The osPriority value specifies the priority for a thread. <b>Note:</b> only one possible value as configMAX_PRIORITIES in FreeRTOS equals to 1
USBH_PROCESS_STACK_SIZE|USBH_PROCESS_STACK_SIZE (The CMSIS-RTOS stack size requirements in bytes)|CMSIS_RTOS|Words|=FREERTOS:configMINIMAL_STACK_SIZE|=FREERTOS:configTOTAL_HEAP_SIZE/4|stack size requirements in word format; 256 word is default stack size
USBH_MAX_NUM_CONFIGURATION|USBH_MAX_NUM_CONFIGURATION (Maximun number of supported configuration)|Host Configuration||1|255|Maximum number of supported Configurations
USBH_KEEP_CFG_DESCRIPTOR|USBH_KEEP_CFG_DESCRIPTOR (Keep the configuration into RAM)|Host Configuration||||Allow to keep full configuration descriptor in RAM when further parsing is needed
USBH_MAX_SIZE_CONFIGURATION|USBH_MAX_SIZE_CONFIGURATION (Maximun size in bytes for the Configuration Descriptor)|Host Configuration|Byte(s)|1|256|Maximum size of configuration descriptor
USBH_MAX_DATA_BUFFER|USBH_MAX_DATA_BUFFER (Maximun size of temporary data)|Host Configuration|Byte(s)|1|65536|Maximum size for USB descriptor container
USBH_DEBUG_LEVEL|USBH_DEBUG_LEVEL (USBH Debug Level)|Host Configuration||||Define different level output trace as folowing : 0 : No debug message is shown 1 : only User message are shown 2 : User + Error messages are shown 3 : All message and interal debug message are shown
VirtualModeFS||Basic Parameters||||
VirtualModeHS||Basic Parameters||||
gState|gState|||HOST_IDLE|HOST_ABORT_STATE|
